# Copy to .env for local development and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit the real .env — it is gitignored.
# In Azure, secrets are pulled from Key Vault via the VM's
# system-assigned managed identity (see terraform/envs/dev/security.tf).

# Example application secrets (replace with what your app actually needs):
# API_KEY=
# DATABASE_URL=
# KEY_VAULT_NAME=
